# Live links

After every build of this site, the reply ends with the live links. This is not optional.

- The Vercel preview URL for the branch that was just built.
- The pull request URL when one is open.

A localhost address does not count. If the latest work is not on the remote, commit it (leave `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` out), push the branch, wait until Vercel marks that deployment Ready, then send the preview URL. Do not finish the turn on a local address alone.

Do not merge. Do not point the production domain at the preview.
